                    Economic Summit and took place at the Akasaka Palace. No drafting information
                    appears on the minutes. See <ref target="#d202-f2">footnotes 2</ref> and <ref
                        target="#d202-f5">5, Document 202</ref>. Additional documentation on the
                    Tokyo Economic Summit is scheduled for publication in <ref
                        target="frus1981-88v37"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations,</hi>
                        1981–1988, vol. XXXVII, Trade; Monetary Policy; Industrialized Country
                        Cooperation, 1985–1988</ref>.</p>
            </note>
